### Contoh request API SIMPRES
### Penjelasan setiap endpoint (aturan, contoh respons, kode status) ada di backend/API.md.
### Semua 32 endpoint dari "php artisan route:list --path=api" punya contoh di file ini.
### Bisa dijalankan dengan ekstensi VS Code "REST Client" atau HTTP Client PhpStorm.
### Jalankan server dulu dari folder backend:  php artisan serve
### Akun contoh dari simpres.sql, password semua akun: simpres123

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
# Isi dengan nilai "token" dari respons login.
@token = TEMPEL_TOKEN_DI_SINI

### 1. Login berhasil -> 200, berisi token dan data pegawai
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "siti@simpres.test",
    "password": "simpres123"
}

### 2. Login password salah -> 422 "Email atau password salah."
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "siti@simpres.test",
    "password": "salah123"
}

### 3. Login tanpa isi -> 422 "Email wajib diisi. (dan 1 kesalahan lainnya)"
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4. Data pegawai yang sedang login -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. /me tanpa token -> 401 "Anda belum login atau token tidak valid. Silakan login kembali."
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Accept: application/json

### 6. Logout (token jadi tidak berlaku) -> 200 "Logout berhasil."
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================================
### Langkah 5. Absensi (token pegawai)
### Titik Puskesmas di database: -5.0222565, 119.6653682 (radius 150 m).
### Dekat (sekitar 22 m): latitude -5.0224565. Jauh (sekitar 200 m): latitude -5.0240565.
### =====================================================================

### 7. Status absensi hari ini (sudah/belum check-in, jadwal hari ini)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/today
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Check-in jauh -> 422 "Anda berada di luar radius Puskesmas ..." dan distance_m sekitar 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-in
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"latitude": -5.0240565, "longitude": 119.6653682, "accuracy": 10, "is_mock": false}

### 9. Check-in akurasi buruk -> 422 "Akurasi GPS terlalu rendah ..."
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-in
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"latitude": -5.0224565, "longitude": 119.6653682, "accuracy": 500, "is_mock": false}

### 10. Check-in lokasi palsu -> 422 "Terdeteksi lokasi palsu ..."
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-in
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"latitude": -5.0224565, "longitude": 119.6653682, "accuracy": 10, "is_mock": true}

### 11. Check-in dekat -> 201 status hadir/terlambat. Kirim ulang dengan client_uuid sama -> 200, data yang sama
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-in
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "latitude": -5.0224565,
    "longitude": 119.6653682,
    "accuracy": 10,
    "is_mock": false,
    "client_uuid": "0b7d3c1e-2f4a-4b5c-8d6e-7f8091a2b3c4",
    "device_info": "Samsung A15, Android 14"
}

### 12. Check-out -> 200. Kirim kedua kali -> 422 "Anda sudah check-out hari ini."
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-out
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"latitude": -5.0224565, "longitude": 119.6653682, "accuracy": 10, "is_mock": false}

### 13. Riwayat absensi per bulan (format YYYY-MM)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance?month=2026-11
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Detail absensi (hanya milik sendiri, milik orang lain -> 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================================
### Langkah 6. Izin dan cuti (token pegawai, kecuali bagian admin)
### Jenis: izin_keluar (wajib start_time & end_time), sakit (wajib lampiran jpg/png maks 2 MB), cuti, lainnya.
### =====================================================================

@tokenAdmin = TEMPEL_TOKEN_ADMIN_DI_SINI

### 15. Ajukan cuti 2 hari -> 201 status menunggu
POST {{baseUrl}}/leaves
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"type": "cuti", "start_date": "2026-11-20", "end_date": "2026-11-21", "reason": "Acara keluarga"}

### 16. Tanggal selesai sebelum tanggal mulai -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/leaves
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"type": "cuti", "start_date": "2026-11-20", "end_date": "2026-11-19", "reason": "Acara keluarga"}

### 17. Izin keluar dengan jam -> 201 (tanpa jam -> 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leaves
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"type": "izin_keluar", "start_date": "2026-11-18", "end_date": "2026-11-18", "start_time": "10:00", "end_time": "11:30", "reason": "Ke bank"}

### 18. Izin sakit dengan foto (multipart/form-data, field "lampiran") -> 201
### Ganti path file di bawah dengan foto jpg/png di komputer kamu.
POST {{baseUrl}}/leaves
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SimpresBatas

--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

sakit
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="start_date"

2026-11-18
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="end_date"

2026-11-18
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="reason"

Demam
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lampiran"; filename="surat.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< D:/foto/surat.jpg
--SimpresBatas--

### 19. Daftar izin milik sendiri (filter status opsional: menunggu, diterima, ditolak)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves?status=menunggu
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Detail izin
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Lampiran izin (hanya pemilik dan admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/2/attachment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. Ubah izin yang masih menunggu (cukup kirim kolom yang berubah)
### Untuk mengganti lampiran: POST multipart ke /leaves/{id} dengan field _method=PUT.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/leaves/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"reason": "Menghadiri pernikahan saudara"}

### 23. Batalkan izin yang masih menunggu -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/leaves/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. Admin: terima atau tolak izin (token pegawai -> 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/leaves/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

{"status": "diterima", "admin_note": "Disetujui, semoga lancar."}

### =====================================================================
### Langkah 7. Koreksi absensi dan tugas lapangan
### =====================================================================

### 25. Ajukan koreksi jam pulang (minimal salah satu: corrected_check_in / corrected_check_out) -> 201
### Lampiran opsional: kirim multipart dengan field "lampiran" (jpg/png maks 2 MB).
POST {{baseUrl}}/corrections
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"date": "2026-11-17", "corrected_check_out": "14:00", "reason": "Lupa absen pulang"}

### 26. Koreksi tanpa jam -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/corrections
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"date": "2026-11-17", "reason": "Lupa absen"}

### 27. Daftar, detail, dan batalkan koreksi (batal hanya jika masih menunggu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/corrections?status=menunggu
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/corrections/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/corrections/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28. Admin: terima koreksi -> jam di tabel attendances ikut berubah
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/corrections/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

{"status": "diterima"}

### 29. Laporkan tugas lapangan dengan foto (multipart, field "foto" jpg maks 2 MB) -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/field-duties
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SimpresBatas

--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="date"

2026-11-17
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location_name"

Posyandu Melati
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Imunisasi balita
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="latitude"

-5.0300000
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="longitude"

119.6700000
--SimpresBatas
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="foto"; filename="kegiatan.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< D:/foto/kegiatan.jpg
--SimpresBatas--

### 30. Daftar dan detail tugas lapangan milik sendiri
GET {{baseUrl}}/field-duties
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/field-duties/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 31. Foto tugas lapangan (pemilik dan admin; pegawai lain -> 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/field-duties/1/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 32. Batalkan tugas lapangan yang masih menunggu
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/field-duties/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 33. Admin: tolak tugas lapangan dengan catatan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/field-duties/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

{"status": "ditolak", "admin_note": "Foto tidak jelas, mohon kirim ulang."}

### =====================================================================
### Langkah 8. Jadwal, notifikasi, lokasi kerja, token FCM
### =====================================================================

### 34. Jadwal per bulan beserta jam shift
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules?month=2026-11
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 35. Titik dan radius lokasi kerja (tanpa token -> 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-location
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 36. Notifikasi (terbaru dulu, ada unread_count)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 37. Tandai satu notifikasi sudah dibaca (milik orang lain -> 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1/read
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 38. Tandai semua notifikasi sudah dibaca
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 39. Simpan token FCM dari HP -> 201 (token sama dikirim ulang -> 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/device-token
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"fcm_token": "contoh-token-fcm-dari-firebase", "platform": "android"}
